
  ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
   Welcome to the Megapot Starter Kit
  ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

  Your .env was just created from .env.example. Open it and customize
  these four — listed in order of impact:


  1) VITE_REFERRER_ADDRESS — your wallet

     Earns the protocol's referral fee on every ticket purchased and
     the referral win share on every winning claimed through this app.

     Defaults to a dead address so the kit boots out of the box, but
     anything earned on the default is unrecoverable. Set this BEFORE
     you ship.


  2) VITE_MEGAPOT_API_KEY — Megapot Data API key

     Mint at: https://megapot.io/dashboard

     Without one, the kit falls back to the anonymous tier
     (10 req/min, 500/day). With a key: 60/min, 10K/day. The Tickets
     and History pages will throttle on the anonymous tier under any
     real traffic.


  3) VITE_WALLETCONNECT_PROJECT_ID — wallet-modal project ID

     Get one at: https://cloud.walletconnect.com  (free, ~2 min signup)

     Without it, injected wallets (MetaMask, Coinbase Wallet, browser
     extensions) still work — but the WalletConnect QR modal that
     mobile wallets scan won't open.


  4) VITE_RPC_URL — strongly recommended even for development

     The default (https://mainnet.base.org) is a public RPC with
     aggressive rate limits, filter-eviction quirks, and occasional
     load-balancer-induced stale reads. Symptoms include
     "filter not found" errors and writes that succeed on chain but
     don't surface in the UI until refresh.

     Free dedicated endpoints that don't have these issues:
       • https://www.alchemy.com/base
       • https://goldsky.com
       • QuickNode, Infura, Ankr — any HTTPS Base RPC works.

     Pick one, paste it in.


  ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

  When you're done editing .env, run:

      pnpm dev

  Then open http://localhost:5173 and connect a wallet.

  Full docs: README.md  ·  Rebrand checklist: docs/CUSTOMIZE.md
  Architecture: docs/ARCHITECTURE.md  ·  Skills: https://llms.megapot.io

